        "Solar Spectrum and Atmospheric Effects",
        "Components of Solar Radiation",
        "Estimating Solar Energy Availability",
        "Solar Energy Conversion Basics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "title": "Psychrometrics and Drying Principles",
      "lessons": [
        "Properties of Air-Water Mixtures",
        "Psychrometric Chart Usage",
        "Wet Bulb and Dry Bulb Temperature",
        "Relative Humidity and Dew Point",
        "Moisture Content and Equilibrium",
        "Drying Rate Curves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "title": "Heat and Mass Transfer in Drying",
      "lessons": [
        "Heat Transfer Mechanisms",
        "Mass Transfer Fundamentals",
        "Convective Drying Theory",
        "Diffusion in Drying",
        "Energy Balance in Dryers",
        "Modeling Drying Kinetics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "title": "Solar Collector Design",
      "lessons": [
